-- A rental as a continuous trade. While the lease runs, the flow vector is
-- { -1000 USD/week, +1 roomweek/week } for the Tenant and its negation for the Landlord:
-- the two sides cancel unit by unit at every moment. 1000 USD per week is the exchange rate
-- between roomweeks (one room for one week) and dollars; over 7 weeks the trade is
-- { -7000 USD, +7 roomweek } for the Tenant.
protocol Rental (Tenant, Landlord) {
  Lease from Landlord to Tenant;
  accrue { 1000 USD per week; -1 roomweek per week; } from Tenant to Landlord;
  MoveOut from Tenant to Landlord after 7 weeks;
}
